// $f(\sin y - \sin x)$ 是由 $f(u)$ 和 $u = \sin y - \sin x$ 复合而成.

用复合函数求导法得

$$
\begin{array}{l} \frac {\partial z}{\partial x} = f ^ {\prime} (u) \frac {\partial u}{\partial x} + y \\ = f ^ {\prime} (\sin y - \sin x) (- \cos x) + y, \\ \frac {\partial z}{\partial y} = f ^ {\prime} (u) \frac {\partial u}{\partial y} + x \\ = f ^ {\prime} (\sin y - \sin x) (\cos y) + x, \end{array}
$$

第二步：代入问题化简求值

$$
\begin{array}{l} \frac {1}{\cos x} \frac {\partial z}{\partial x} + \frac {1}{\cos y} \frac {\partial z}{\partial y} \\ = - f ^ {\prime} (\sin y - \sin x) + \frac {y}{\cos x} + \\ f ^ {\prime} (\sin y - \sin x) + \frac {x}{\cos y} \\ = \frac {x}{\cos y} + \frac {y}{\cos x}. \end{array}
$$

